<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: 0, background: '#FFFFFF', position: 'relative' }}>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 0, top: 0, width: 1280, height: 72, background: '#0E3F8C', paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>实验结果：精度与速度都能支撑演示</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 0, top: 72, width: 1280, height: 2, background: '#3D7BD9' }} />

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 40, top: 100, width: 600, height: 480, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 10, padding: 14 }}>
    <Chart
      style={{ width: '100%', height: 410 }}
      chartType='barChart'
      barDirection='column'
      title='16 类检测模型指标'
      titleColor='#0E3F8C'
      showLegend={false}
      showDataLabels={true}
      axisColor='#4A5568'
      dataLabelColor='#1A2230'
      colors={['#1E4FA8']}
      background='#FFFFFF'
      data={[
        ['指标', '检测版'],
        ['mAP50', 0.832],
        ['mAP50-95', 0.671],
        ['Precision', 0.810],
        ['Recall', 0.788],
      ]}
    />
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', textAlign: 'center', lineHeight: 1.4, marginTop: 8 }}>指标来自 734 张验证图、1551 个验证实例；CPU 推理约 19.1 ms / 张。</Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 660, top: 100, width: 580, height: 360 }}>
    <Table
      style={{ width: '100%', height: '100%' }}
      defaultTextStyle={{ fontSize: 16, textAlign: 'left', color: '#1A2230' }}
      defaultCellStyle={{ border: { left: { width: 1, color: '#E5E7EB' }, right: { width: 1, color: '#E5E7EB' }, top: { width: 1, color: '#E5E7EB' }, bottom: { width: 1, color: '#E5E7EB' } } }}
      cells={[
        [{ text: '对比项', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#FFFFFF' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#0E3F8C' } } }, { text: '整图分类版', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#FFFFFF' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#0E3F8C' } } }, { text: '多目标检测版', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#FFFFFF' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#0E3F8C' } } }],
        ['输出形式', '整图单标签', '类别 + 框 + 置信度'],
        ['目标数量', '1 个', '一张图多个'],
        ['定位能力', '无', 'xyxy 检测框'],
        ['成熟度粒度', '有限类别', '16 类细粒度'],
        ['演示入口', '上传 / 摄像头', '上传 / 拖拽 / 示例 / 摄像头'],
        ['mAP50', '不适用', '0.832'],
      ]}
    />
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 660, top: 478, width: 580, height: 108, background: '#E8EFF8', borderRadius: 10, padding: 16, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>判断：mAP50 0.832 说明在当前拼装数据集上具备可用检测精度；19.1 ms / 张说明普通 CPU 上即可完成流畅演示。但它不等于真实光照下的泛化能力。</Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 40, top: 620, width: 1200, height: 32, background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 8, paddingLeft: 18, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>数据结论：精度、速度、功能完整性三者同时成立，项目才从“模型实验”变成“可答辩演示的系统”。</Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 40, top: 668, width: 700, height: 24 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>水果成熟度智能分级与检测系统</Text></Box>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', right: 40, top: 668, width: 120, height: 24 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1E4FA8', textAlign: 'right' }}>09 / 12</Text></Box>
</Slide>
